# Rocdown

Rocdown is the document language and static-site compiler. Write pages in Markdown, declare metadata with `@page`, and keep presentation in `.rocci` layouts. Rust owns the catalog; Rocci owns the visible shell.

:note[title: "Static pages stay Markdown-first"] {{
    Ordinary `.rocdown` site pages cannot include `@roc` or `@component` islands yet. Use article blocks such as `:note` and Markdown here; put chrome in `site/theme/`.
}}

