## Page metadata

```rocdown
@page {
    layout: "docs",
    meta: {
        title: "Getting Started",
        description: "Orientation and first success with Rocci",
    },
}
```

Named layouts currently available: `home`, `faq`, `product`, `section`, `docs`, `plain`, and `not-found`.
